<title>UK: Expro International year profit rises 24 pct.</title>
<headline>Expro International year profit rises 24 pct.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-06-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>12 months to March 31</p>
<p>			   (million stg unless stated)</p>
<p> Shr (pence)		21.2		   vs 17.6</p>
<p> Dividend (pence)	 5.35		   vs 4.7</p>
<p> Total dividend (pence) 8.0		    vs 7.0</p>
<p> Pretax		     17.8		   vs 14.3</p>
<p> Turnover		   105.0		  vs 82.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the oil services company is Expro International Group Plc</p>
